        "text": "Nord, what are you building? So I work for Multichain Advisors. We're a boutique consulting firm. The crypto space that's trying to be like the Bain McKenzie BCG of crypto. In the last three years we've helped over 60 projects with their token generation events and their pivots throughout all the chaos of FTX and Luna. We're out here supporting builders. We help launch Wormhole Pit, Zeus, Gaming, Sharkyfy, a bunch of other projects on Solana. We respect the Solana builders and we help the technical founders with everything non technical. If you need help, come find us at multichainadvisors on Twitter. Or you can find crypto8.0 on Twitter and we run Twitter spaces every Wednesday. You heard him try it out.",
